isHilbSegment -- hilb-segment ideals
************************************

  * Usage: 
        isHilbSegment J
  * Inputs:
      * J, a *note monomial ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)MonomialIdeal,, or
      * J, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a strongly stable ideal.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, 

Description
===========

Calls the method *note isGenSegment: isGenSegment, on the ideal
truncate(gotzmannNumber(hilbertPolynomial J), J).



+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x,y,z];                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J = ideal(x^2,x*y,y^4);                                       |
|                                                                   |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[x..z]                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isHilbSegment J                                               |
|                                                                   |
|o3 = (true, {7, 3, 1})                                             |
|                                                                   |
|o3 : Sequence                                                      |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isGenSegment(truncate(gotzmannNumber(hilbertPolynomial J), J))|
|                                                                   |
|o4 = (true, {7, 3, 1})                                             |
|                                                                   |
|o4 : Sequence                                                      |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+

